# Production / new domain (realielts.tech) — set these on the deployment host:
# Auth.js v5 in production requires a trusted host, otherwise sign-in fails
# with an "UntrustedHost" error.
# AUTH_URL=https://www.realielts.tech
# AUTH_TRUST_HOST=true
# Also update the Google Cloud Console for the new domain:
#   - Authorized redirect URI: https://www.realielts.tech/api/auth/callback/google
#     (and https://realielts.tech/api/auth/callback/google for the apex domain)
#   - Authorized JavaScript origins: https://www.realielts.tech (and apex)

